# AXI4 Full 32-bit INCR burst, 4 beats, ID=1. Illustrative, not RTL simulation.
# One LWF tick = half clock cycle; rising edges at 1,3,5,...,31.
# Each row is the state AFTER the boundary at that tick.
# All non-clock transitions occur on rising edges; sample pre-edge values (tick-1).
# ARESETn releases after edge 5. First request launches after edge 7.
# AW handshake: 11. W handshakes: 13,15,21,23. B handshake: 29.
# D2 is stalled at edges 17,19; WLAST is asserted for D3 only.
# Unchanged control levels use no forced boundaries; x payloads are invalid/don't-care.

